      "masked-dust-volume",
      "masked-warp-caustics",
      "masked-accretion-glow",
      "masked-singularity-corona",
      "masked-beyond-color-field"
    ],
    "protectedPixelDeltaMaximum": 0,
    "rules": [
      "The approved 3D camera solve is never regenerated, interpolated, reframed, or stabilized by AI.",
      "The rocket silhouette, transform, material identity, exhaust sockets, and motion are never regenerated by AI.",
      "Planet geometry, scale, limbs, surface landmarks, orbital paths, and occlusion remain the authored 3D render.",
      "Every AI-assisted image is a separate alpha-bearing layer constrained by an authoritative 3D matte.",
      "AI output is composited over the authoritative beauty render and can be disabled without changing story continuity.",
      "Generated text, logos, voices, faces, and unmasked full-frame AI video are prohibited."
    ]
  },
